###  https://w3id.org/rsdo#CompletelyWeathered
rsdo:CompletelyWeathered rdf:type owl:Class ;
                         rdfs:subClassOf rsdo:RockWeatheringDegreeAttribute .


###  https://w3id.org/rsdo#Composition
rsdo:Composition rdf:type owl:Class ;
                 rdfs:subClassOf rsdo:MaterialAttribute .


###  https://w3id.org/rsdo#ControlPointAttribute
rsdo:ControlPointAttribute rdf:type owl:Class ;
                           rdfs:subClassOf rsdo:ProfessionAttribute .


